      "value": "Create and execute a Python experiment to test the neural network capacity scaling hypothesis. Build feedforward networks with widths w∈{8,16,32}, vary constraint count N∈{1,2,4,8}, train to target training error, count validation violations, determine N_c(w), and fit log-log scaling β. Include convergence safeguards for small widths and validate against the criteria |β|<0.15 (H1) or β>0.3,R²>0.85 (H2)."
